		{"id":"70d2ae26254ec124","type":"text","text":"1.下载源代码","x":3800,"y":-793,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"9fc0f993ce1cdca7","type":"text","text":"2.搭建Python环境","x":3800,"y":-540,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"50b0486fdb01fabe","type":"file","file":"guide/yolo/assets/20260825113200.png","x":600,"y":-280,"width":400,"height":337},
		{"id":"d928598744ce4e2a","type":"text","text":"yolo的训练","x":3340,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f5a665da5e181289","type":"text","text":"rknn-toolkit2获取","x":4879,"y":340,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7e9399ada2db987a","type":"text","text":"YOLO 给了你一张 25200 行、85 列的大表。","x":600,"y":585,"width":397,"height":50},
		{"id":"1debbb56d404d87b","type":"file","file":"guide/yolo/assets/20260825113437.png","x":600,"y":170,"width":400,"height":260},
		{"id":"8e2652df4b5237d4","type":"text","text":"```\n             85个数字\n       ┌────────────────────────────┐\n候选框0 │ x y w h obj cls0 cls1 ... │\n候选框1 │ x y w h obj cls0 cls1 ... │\n候选框2 │ x y w h obj cls0 cls1 ... │\n候选框3 │ x y w h obj cls0 cls1 ... │\n       │ ...                        │\n       │ ...                        │\n候选框  │                            │\n25200  │                            │\n       └────────────────────────────┘\n```","x":1135,"y":520,"width":585,"height":300},
		{"id":"13425355f2234411","type":"text","text":"1.模型路径\n2.图片路径\n3.默认输入尺寸","x":660,"y":1390,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"dba82bc1afb96697","type":"text","text":"代码理解","x":-240,"y":1200,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"87be3cee88848b13","type":"text","text":"MODEL_PATH = \"yolov5s.onnx\"\nIMAGE_PATH = \"data/images/zidane.jpg\"\nDEFAULT_INPUT_SIZE = (640, 640)  # (height, width)","x":1060,"y":1375,"width":500,"height":110},
		{"id":"c529f95b99803de5","type":"text","text":"第 3 课：研究 ? 为什么是那个数","x":205,"y":580,"width":280,"height":60},
		{"id":"b45f6088db3c8166","type":"text","text":"环境准备","x":205,"y":1040,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"016f0ede256b6923","type":"text","text":"第 2 课：只看 Output","x":220,"y":270,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d5327a5491ac599a","type":"text","text":"第 1 课：只看 Input","x":220,"y":-141,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2ca60e7cb14ec0fc","type":"text","text":"解读：tensor: `float16[1,3,640,640]`\n\ndbyte:float16\nN:1 batch = 1 ，一次处理一张图片\nC:3 channel = 3 ，图片颜色：RGB\nH:640 height=640,输入图片高度\nW:640 weight=640,输入图片宽度","x":1720,"y":-209,"width":385,"height":196},
		{"id":"1b53422d94c7f1fb","type":"file","file":"guide/yolo/assets/20260825113219.png","x":1200,"y":-257,"width":400,"height":291},
		{"id":"7e7ff28542bed169","type":"text","text":"25200??","x":1853,"y":429,"width":120,"height":50},
		{"id":"8f81ea7d5bc9752c","type":"file","file":"guide/yolo/assets/20260825113448.png","x":1200,"y":181,"width":399,"height":298},
		{"id":"8f0413da56f7f27c","type":"text","text":"解读：tensor: `float16[1,25200,85]`\ndbyte：float16\nbatch:1\n85 = xywh(坐标) + obj(置信度) + class(类别)\n","x":1720,"y":271,"width":385,"height":118},
		{"id":"348796c61af3f68e","type":"text","text":"[什么是Tensor](blog/yolo/什么是Tensor.md)","x":-1160,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"09cd635ad1ca4412","type":"text","text":"配置相关环境变量","x":205,"y":1400,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7e26c5ac7a2bf4cf","type":"text","text":"# 0. 环境准备\n\n需要：\n\n- `onnxruntime`\n- `opencv-python`\n- `numpy`\n- `matplotlib`\n\n如果缺包，取消下一行的 `#` 再运行。","x":660,"y":920,"width":250,"height":300},
		{"id":"eb3a6072b9464968","type":"text","text":"pip install onnxruntime opencv-python numpy matplotlib","x":1060,"y":1040,"width":500,"height":60},
		{"id":"462edf66cd740667","type":"text","text":"[如何看懂一个yolo模型](blog/yolo/如何看懂一个yolo模型.md)","x":-1160,"y":-141,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"238f84194323adb5","type":"text","text":"Nerton查看yolo模型","x":-240,"y":240,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7d2a96977a34dbc3","type":"text","text":"手动安装：[Pytorch 手动安装教程 【超快|适用于国内没有源的方法】_手动安装pytorch-CSDN博客](https://blog.csdn.net/chui_yu666/article/details/145516315?spm=1001.2014.3001.5501)","x":6100,"y":-340,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"eb795a8fb2aa8f21","type":"text","text":"指令安装","x":6100,"y":-430,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5b5e1e3ec5ff4f85","type":"text","text":"Pytorch安装","x":5770,"y":-400,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"03c5d3cebad09ba8","type":"text","text":"pip install torch==1.13.1+cu117 torchvision==0.14.1+cu117 torchaudio==0.13.1 --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu117","x":6406,"y":-430,"width":334,"height":60},
		{"id":"fb55d4d682881f15","type":"text","text":"pip install -r requirements.txt","x":6100,"y":-2,"width":330,"height":60},
		{"id":"151fff18496fe82a","type":"text","text":"python环境 = 房间","x":5770,"y":-740,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"83ea28457097a9cd","type":"text","text":"相关笔记：\nPython版本：3.10 \nTorch版本：1.13.1 \n安装完成后还需要\npip一下yolo的库： pip install ultralytics","x":5770,"y":-269,"width":384,"height":149},
		{"id":"30c2f43f0c4fbccc","type":"text","text":"pip install ultralytics","x":5770,"y":-90,"width":250,"height":60},
